    "reason": "The whole unchanged plate supplies a readable coordinated seasonal alternative on the retained fictional person: sage camp-collar short sleeves, sand loose ankle trousers and navy/ivory low shoes, with two complete clothed figures and a larger unobscured portrait. The actual face/bob/skin texture and qualitative adult proportions remain coherent with the original concept. Every required image criterion is sufficiently met for this artist consumer; no actionable brief-level defect is proved. Acceptance does not convert these authored pixels into hidden-body, material-physics or registered-source evidence.",
