        "criterion": "Complete coordinated seasonal outfit",
        "sourceWitness": "BRIEF owns sage above-elbow sleeves, open camp collar, relaxed upper-hip untucked hem, sand loose ankle trousers and navy canvas low shoes with warm-ivory flat soles. Original concept instead visibly wears a pale-blue long-sleeve crew knit, charcoal wide trousers and brown boots.",
